From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cappy Ishihara <cappy@cappuchino.xyz>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm: sun4i: route CPU-trigger DSI through TCON-TOP

The A523 CPU-trigger DSI path must select the DE-to-LCD1 route before the
single-master trigger starts. Keep this route selection specific to the DSI
CPU path; it is not a generic continuous-TCON experiment.

Signed-off-by: Cappy Ishihara <cappy@cappuchino.xyz>

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_tcon.c
@@ -738,6 +738,7 @@
 	case DRM_MODE_ENCODER_DSI:
 		/* DSI is tied to special case of CPU interface */
 		sun4i_tcon0_mode_set_cpu(tcon, encoder, mode);
+		sun4i_tcon_set_mux(tcon, 0, encoder);
 		break;
 	case DRM_MODE_ENCODER_LVDS:
 		sun4i_tcon0_mode_set_lvds(tcon, encoder, mode);
-- 
2.43.0
